Tester box 59368: POST /contacts/:id/labels answered 500, logged as „inconsistent types deduced for parameter $3“ — the label sat in the INSERT's select list (unknown) and in a comparison (varchar). Every parameter of that statement is typed now, the source as "TagSource". FOR_FRONTEND tells the frontend 0317 and 0318 are live, the labels fix, and which id /members and /paths take.

